<h1>Rules</h1>
<p>Before using the site, you should read through these rules & our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>, both of which may be changed at any time. Continuing to use the site means you agree with these policies.</p>
<ul>
<li>No attacks directed towards any individuals, race, gender, religion or sexual identity.</li>
<li>No spam. This includes chain letters, referral links, posting the same thing many times in different places, and anything that involves, or encourages other users to, repost identical or similar content.</li>
<li>No glorification of criminal activity.</li>
<li>Posting anyone else's personal information <strong>anywhere on the site</strong> is not allowed. This includes name, physical address, email address, phone number etc.</li>
<li>Reviews must follow the rating of the story.</li>
<li>You must be at least 13 years old to use Fanfiction Online.</li>
<li>Stories published must follow the <a href="/guidelines">content guidelines</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>If you feel these rules are being violated on the site, <a href="/contact">send us a message</a> and we'll look in to it.</p>
<p>If you have a question, you can check the <a href="/faq">FAQ</a> for answers. If the question has not yet been asked, you can ask it there.</p>
<p>We want to create the best experience for fanfiction readers & writers, so we're always looking to improve. If you have any suggestions, or if you want to point out an issue, <a href="/contact">send us a message</a>.</p>